<title>USA: Innotech names COO Bennington president.</title>
<headline>Innotech names COO Bennington president.</headline>
<dateline>ROANOKE, Va. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innotech Inc said on Tuesday it named Chief Operating Officer Steven Bennington to the additional position of company president.</p>
<p>Bennington joined Innotech in June 1992 as vice president of operations and was named chief operating officer in September 1993, the company said in a statement.  </p>
<p>The president position had been vacant for over a year, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Innotech produces on-site eyeglass lens manufacturing systems and lens products.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
